      ]
    ],
    [
      "block",
      "paragraph",
      [
        [
          "text",
          "These values are for normal use from the boot medium. Actual applications may need more memory."
        ]
      ]
    ],
    [
      "block",
      "paragraph",
      [
        [
          "text",
          ""
        ],
        [
          "span",
          "strong",
          [
            [
              "text",
              "Run from RAM"
            ]
          ]
        ],
        [
          "text",
          " needs additional memory because MiniOS data is copied into RAM alongside the running system and applications. Larger images therefore require substantially more memory in this mode."
        ]
      ]
    ],
    [
      "block",
      "paragraph",
      [
        [
          "text",
          "See "
        ],
        [
          "link",
          "/using-minios/Boot-Modes.md",
          null,
          [
            [
              "text",
              "Boot modes"
            ]
          ]
        ],
        [
          "text",
          " before using "
        ],
        [
          "span",
          "strong",
          [
            [
              "text",
              "Run from RAM"
            ]
          ]
        ],
        [
          "text",
          " on a memory-constrained computer."
        ]
      ]
    ],
    [
      "heading",
      2,
      "graphics",
      [
        [
          "text",
          "Graphics"
        ]
      ]
    ],
    [
      "block",
      "paragraph",
      [
        [
          "text",
          "Current amd64 MiniOS images use the Debian graphics stack with Xorg and Mesa."
        ],
        [
          "text",
          "\n"
        ],
        [
          "text",
          "The kernel includes Intel "
        ],
        [
          "span",
          "code",
          [
            [
              "text",
              "i915"
            ]
          ]
        ],
        [
          "text",
          " and "
        ],
        [
          "span",
          "code",
          [
            [
              "text",
              "xe"
            ]
          ]
        ],
        [
          "text",
          ", AMD "
        ],
        [
          "span",
          "code",
          [
            [
              "text",
              "amdgpu"
            ]
          ]
        ],
        [
          "text",
          " and "
        ],
        [
          "span",
          "code",
          [
            [
              "text",
              "radeon"
            ]
          ]
        ],
        [
          "text",
          ", and the open-source NVIDIA "
        ],
        [
          "span",
          "code",
          [
            [
              "text",
              "nouveau"
            ]
          ]
        ],
        [
          "text",
          " driver."
        ]
      ]
    ],
    [
      "block",
      "paragraph",
      [
        [
          "text",
          "Xorg includes its generic "
        ],
        [
          "span",
          "code",
          [
            [
              "text",
              "modesetting"
            ]
          ]
        ],
        [
          "text",
          " driver together with Intel, AMD/ATI, Radeon, Nouveau, VESA, and framebuffer drivers. Mesa provides the normal 3D acceleration stack used by Intel, AMD, and supported open-source drivers."
        ]
      ]
    ],
    [
      "block",
      "paragraph",
      [
        [
          "text",
          "Debian-based MiniOS images install the Debian firmware collections alongside vendor-specific firmware packages. The current Trixie Standard image includes "
        ],
        [
          "span",
          "code",
          [
            [
              "text",
              "firmware-amd-graphics"
            ]
          ]
        ],
        [
          "text",
          " and "
        ],
        [
          "span",
          "code",
          [
            [
              "text",
              "firmware-misc-nonfree"
            ]
          ]
        ],
        [
          "text",
          "; Ubuntu-based images use "
        ],
        [
          "span",
          "code",
          [
            [
              "text",
              "linux-firmware"
            ]
          ]
        ],
        [
          "text",
          " instead."
        ]
      ]
    ],
    [
      "block",
      "paragraph",
      [
        [
          "text",
          "The maintained MiniOS package lists do not include the proprietary NVIDIA kernel driver. NVIDIA hardware therefore uses the included "
        ],
        [
          "span",
          "code",
          [
            [
              "text",
              "nouveau"
            ]
          ]
        ],
        [
          "text",
          " driver by default. Hardware or features that specifically require NVIDIA's proprietary driver need it to be added separately."
        ]
      ]
    ],
    [
      "block",
      "paragraph",
      [
        [
          "text",
          "Virtual graphics are also covered by kernel and Xorg drivers for common VMware, QXL, Bochs, and Hyper-V devices."
        ]
      ]
    ],
    [
      "heading",
      2,
      "network-hardware",
      [
        [
          "text",
          "Network hardware"
        ]
      ]
    ],
    [
      "block",
      "paragraph",
      [
        [
          "text",
          "Current amd64 MiniOS images use the Debian kernel with its normal networking driver set. The 6.12 kernel used by current Trixie images includes drivers for common Intel, Realtek, Broadcom, Atheros, MediaTek, Ralink, Marvell, and other Ethernet and Wi-Fi hardware."
        ]
      ]
    ],
    [
      "block",
      "paragraph",
      [
        [
          "text",
          "Common Ethernet drivers include Intel "
        ],
        [
          "span",
          "code",
          [
            [
              "text",
              "e1000"
            ]
          ]
        ],
        [
          "text",
          ", "
        ],
        [
          "span",
          "code",
          [
            [
              "text",
              "e1000e"
            ]
          ]
        ],
        [
          "text",
          ", "
        ],
        [
          "span",
          "code",
          [
            [
              "text",
              "igb"
            ]
          ]
        ],
        [
          "text",
          ", "
        ],
        [
          "span",
          "code",
          [
            [
              "text",
              "igc"
            ]
          ]
        ],
        [
          "text",
          ", "
        ],
        [
          "span",
          "code",
          [
            [
              "text",
              "i40e"
            ]
          ]
        ],
        [
          "text",
          ", "
        ],
        [
          "span",
          "code",
          [
            [
              "text",
              "ice"
            ]
          ]
        ],
        [
          "text",
          ", and "
        ],
        [
          "span",
          "code",
          [
            [
              "text",
              "ixgbe"
            ]
          ]
        ],
        [
          "text",
          "; Realtek "
        ],
        [
          "span",
          "code",
          [
            [
              "text",
              "8139"
            ]
          ]
        ],
        [
          "text",
          " and "
        ],
        [
          "span",
          "code",
          [
            [
              "text",
              "r8169"
            ]
          ]
        ],
        [
          "text",
          "; Broadcom "
        ],
        [
          "span",
          "code",
          [
            [
              "text",
              "tg3"
            ]
          ]
        ],
        [
          "text",
          ", "
        ],
        [
          "span",
          "code",
          [
            [
              "text",
              "bnx2"
            ]
          ]
        ],
        [
          "text",
          ", "
        ],
        [
          "span",
          "code",
          [
            [
              "text",
              "bnx2x"
            ]
          ]
        ],
        [
          "text",
          ", and "
        ],
        [
          "span",
          "code",
          [
            [
              "text",
              "bnxt"
            ]
          ]
        ],
        [
          "text",
          "; Atheros "
        ],
        [
          "span",
          "code",
          [
            [
              "text",
              "atl*"
            ]
          ]
        ],
        [
          "text",
          " and "
        ],
        [
          "span",
          "code",
          [
            [
              "text",
              "alx"
            ]
          ]
        ],
        [
          "text",
          "; Marvell "
        ],
        [
          "span",
          "code",
          [
            [
              "text",
              "sky2"
            ]
          ]
        ],
        [
          "text",
          "; and common USB Ethernet drivers such as ASIX, "
        ],
        [
          "span",
          "code",
          [
            [
              "text",
              "r8152"
            ]
          ]
        ],
        [
          "text",
          ", CDC Ethernet/NCM, and RNDIS."
        ]
      ]
    ],
    [
      "block",
      "paragraph",
      [
        [
          "text",
          "Wi-Fi support includes Intel "
        ],
        [
          "span",
          "code",
          [
            [
              "text",
              "iwlwifi"
            ]
          ]
        ],
        [
          "text",
          "; Atheros "
        ],
        [
          "span",
          "code",
          [
            [
              "text",
              "ath5k"
            ]
          ]
        ],
        [
          "text",
          ", "
        ],
        [
          "span",
          "code",
          [
            [
              "text",
              "ath9k"
            ]
          ]
        ],
        [
          "text",
          ", "
        ],
        [
          "span",
          "code",
          [
            [
              "text",
              "ath10k"
            ]
          ]
        ],
        [
          "text",
          ", "
        ],
        [
          "span",
          "code",
          [
            [
              "text",
              "ath11k"
            ]
          ]
        ],
        [
          "text",
          ", and "
        ],
        [
          "span",
          "code",
          [
            [
              "text",
              "ath12k"
            ]
          ]
        ],
        [
          "text",
          "; Broadcom "
        ],
        [
          "span",
          "code",
          [
            [
              "text",
              "brcmfmac"
            ]
          ]
        ],
        [
          "text",
          ", "
        ],
        [
          "span",
          "code",
          [
            [
              "text",
              "brcmsmac"
            ]
          ]
        ],
        [
          "text",
          ", and "
        ],
        [
          "span",
          "code",
          [
            [
              "text",
              "b43"
            ]
          ]
        ],
        [
          "text",
          "; MediaTek "
        ],
        [
          "span",
          "code",
          [
            [
              "text",
              "mt76"
            ]
          ]
        ],
        [
          "text",
          "; Ralink "
        ],
        [
          "span",
          "code",
          [
            [
              "text",
              "rt2x00"
            ]
          ]
        ],
        [
          "text",
          "; Realtek "
        ],
        [
          "span",
          "code",
          [
            [
              "text",
              "rtl8xxxu"
            ]
          ]
        ],
        [
          "text",
          ", "
        ],
        [
          "span",
          "code",
          [
            [
              "text",
              "rtlwifi"
            ]
          ]
        ],
        [
          "text",
          ", "
        ],
        [
          "span",
          "code",
          [
            [
              "text",
              "rtw88"
            ]
          ]
        ],
        [
          "text",
          ", and "
        ],
        [
          "span",
          "code",
          [
            [
              "text",
              "rtw89"
            ]
          ]
        ],
        [
          "text",
          "; and several older Marvell, Intersil, ZyDAS, and other drivers."
        ]
      ]
    ],
    [
      "block",
      "paragraph",
      [
        [
          "text",
          "MiniOS also adds DKMS modules for hardware not covered well enough by the stock kernel. The current amd64 module set includes additional Realtek USB Wi-Fi drivers for RTL8188EU, RTL8814AU, RTL8811/RTL8821AU and related RTL88xxAU adapters, plus the Broadcom STA "
        ],
        [
          "span",
          "code",
          [
            [
              "text",
              "wl"
            ]
          ]
        ],
        [
          "text",
          " driver."
        ]
      ]
    ],
    [
      "block",
      "paragraph",
      [
        [
          "text",
          "The firmware set includes Debian firmware packages for Intel, Atheros, Realtek, MediaTek, Broadcom, Marvell/Libertas, Cavium, and other common network hardware."
        ],
        [
          "text",
          "\n"
        ],
        [
          "text",
          "Exact availability still depends on the MiniOS release, architecture, and selected kernel."
        ]
      ]
    ],
    [
      "block",
      "paragraph",
      [
        [
          "text",
          "For ordinary networking after boot, MiniOS uses NetworkManager. If an adapter is not detected at all, changing NetworkManager settings will not supply a missing kernel driver or firmware. See "
        ],
        [
          "link",
          "/using-minios/Networking.md",
          null,
          [
            [
              "text",
              "Network configuration"
            ]
          ]
        ],
        [
          "text",
          " for normal network use."
        ]
      ]
    ],
    [
      "heading",
      2,
      "storage",
      [
        [
          "text",
          "Storage"
        ]
      ]
    ],
    [
      "block",
      "paragraph",
      [
        [
          "text",
          "For a live MiniOS boot, the storage controller matters twice: the firmware must be able to start the bootloader, and the MiniOS initramfs must then be able to see the device that contains the "
        ],
        [
          "span",
          "code",
          [
            [
              "text",
              "minios/"
            ]
          ]
        ],
        [
          "text",
          " data tree."
        ]
      ]
    ],
    [
      "block",
      "paragraph",
      [
        [
          "text",
          "MiniOS intentionally includes only selected storage drivers in its initramfs."
        ],
        [
          "text",
          "\n"
        ],
        [
          "text",
          "The current builders always include IDE/PATA/SATA, NVMe, SD/MMC, USB mass storage/UAS, and Hyper-V storage support. Standard, Toolbox, and Ultra also add VirtIO block/SCSI and VMware PVSCSI support to the initramfs; Flux does not."
        ]
      ]
    ],
    [
      "block",
      "paragraph",
      [
        [
          "text",
          "The full kernel module tree contains additional storage drivers that are not available during early MiniOS source discovery. If the boot menu appears but MiniOS cannot find its modules, see "
        ],
        [
          "link",
          "/reference/boot-process/System-Discovery.md",
          null,
          [
            [
              "text",
              "Initrd system discovery"
            ]
          ]
        ],
        [
          "text",
          "."
        ]
      ]
    ],
    [
      "heading",
      2,
      "virtual-machines",
      [
        [
          "text",
          "Virtual machines"
        ]
      ]
    ],
    [
      "block",
      "paragraph",
      [
        [
          "text",
          "MiniOS supports the common virtual hardware used by VirtualBox, VMware, QEMU/KVM, and Hyper-V. For boot media and installation target disks, prefer an "
        ],
        [
          "span",
          "strong",
          [
